---
/** Optional explanation alongside discovery; no storage or account requirement added. */
---
<details class="planning-help">
  <summary>Save a possibility or plan a visit?</summary>
  <div>
    <p><strong>Save</strong> keeps a shortlist in <a href="/me/saved/">Saved places</a>. <strong>Add to trip</strong> puts a chosen stop into <a href="/me/trip/">My trip</a>, where you can arrange your day.</p>
    <p>You can start as a guest on this device. Saving or adding a stop does not reserve a table, room or ticket. Check opening times and bookings with the operator before travelling.</p>
  </div>
</details>
<style>
  .planning-help { border-block: 1px solid var(--border); margin-block: 1rem; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--soft); }
  summary { min-height: 44px; padding-block: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  p { max-width: 75ch; margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  a { color: var(--teal-text); text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
</style>
